{"4601790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mirage - Idle RPG", "steam_appid": 4601790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mirage is an idle survivor where you fight huge waves of enemies, bullet heaven style, collect their loot, and grow stronger with every run. Battle, craft, farm, run a shop, and keep progressing even while you're away.   <br> <br>Between battles, explore the town, visit your forge, shop, menagerie and garden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">4 Playable Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from <strong>four classes</strong>: the <strong>Knight,</strong> the <strong>Ranger</strong>, the <strong>Miner</strong>, or the <strong>Mage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/5bffe492b9201be6593dda1fece5d577.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=376 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/5bffe492b9201be6593dda1fece5d577.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/5bffe492b9201be6593dda1fece5d577.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/d3a0b71ec46cea878957efab3d146383.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=376 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/d3a0b71ec46cea878957efab3d146383.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/d3a0b71ec46cea878957efab3d146383.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/637ed00cf34fc9fedb810e7a45a8f9dd.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=374 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/637ed00cf34fc9fedb810e7a45a8f9dd.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/637ed00cf34fc9fedb810e7a45a8f9dd.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/ad5148a800e071892d64d29d8a0fc998.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=376 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/ad5148a800e071892d64d29d8a0fc998.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/ad5148a800e071892d64d29d8a0fc998.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow stronger with more than 100 different upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/8173bffffcbb881d47833868789626eb.avif?t=1787056186\" width=430 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stock your displays with drops, crafted items, and harvested plants. Customers walk in, browse, and buy, but be careful,  as thieves will try to steal your goods. A mysterious dealer occasionally visits with rare, powerful artifacts. Hire employees so that your shop earns gold even while you're away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/0fa6f887df411c44d0226ae5521dffab.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=376 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/0fa6f887df411c44d0226ae5521dffab.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/0fa6f887df411c44d0226ae5521dffab.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow and harvest different plants to use as upgrade materials and other improvements. Every plant you grow unlocks its own reward track as you master it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/28eb09c3ba238306fe658c736dda7c54.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=376 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/28eb09c3ba238306fe658c736dda7c54.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/28eb09c3ba238306fe658c736dda7c54.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Forge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stoke the flames and <strong>craft</strong> different materials to grow stronger through upgrades. Manage heat, unlock anvils, and discover rare materials to craft increasingly powerful components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/d48333a6ace41e5d6fa47689b33f0c23.poster.avif?t=1787056186\" width=376 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/d48333a6ace41e5d6fa47689b33f0c23.webm?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601790/extras/d48333a6ace41e5d6fa47689b33f0c23.mp4?t=1787056186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mirage is an idle survivor where you fight huge waves of enemies, bullet heaven style, collect their loot, and grow stronger with every run. Battle, craft, farm, run a shop, and keep progressing even while you're away.   <br> <br>Between battles, explore the town, visit your forge, shop, menagerie and garden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">4 Playable Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from <strong>four classes</strong>: the <strong>Knight,</strong> the <strong>Ranger</strong>, the <strong>Miner</strong>, or the <strong>Mage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster